{"title": "第2章", "index": 1, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body>\n<div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 0.85em;line-height: 1.2em;\">Discours sur l'origine et les fondements de</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 0.85em;line-height: 1.2em;\">l'inégalité parmi les hommes</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 0.85em;margin-top: 1.5em; line-height: 1.2em;\">\n<b>Jean-Jacques Rousseau</b>\n</div>\n<div class=\"shuming\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 1.5em;\">论人类不平等<span style=\"letter-spacing:0;\">的</span>\n<br/>\r\n起源和基<span style=\"letter-spacing:0;\">础</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div><br/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"songti\" style=\"text-align: right;font-size: 0.7em;\">[法]让-雅克·卢梭 著</div>\n<div class=\"songti\" style=\"text-align: right;font-size: 0.7em;\">邓冰艳 译</div>\n<div class=\"chubanshe\"><img alt=\"zhejiangwenyi\" src=\"Image00002.gif\" style=\"height:2em;\"/>\n</div>\n<h1 class=\"sigil_not_in_toc\" hidden=\"hidden\" title=\"扉页\"></h1>\n</div>\n</body>"}]}